OL,3,GNEWSAFerret show makes return after
OL,4,Aevent success
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of ferrets and their owners
OL,7,Fare coming together in a church hall
OL,8,Ffor a town's ferret show.
OL,10,FThe Old Billingham Ferret Show is
OL,11,Freturning to St Cuthbert's Church Hall
OL,12,Fin Billingham, Stockton, for its second
OL,13,Fyear.
OL,15,FOrganiser Janine Hipkins said about 100
OL,16,Fpeople attended last year with 300
OL,17,Fferrets in total and she expected
OL,18,Fsimilar numbers this year, with awards
OL,19,Falso handed out to the best ferrets in
OL,20,Fshow.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
